url: "https://noesis.dev"

abstract: >-
  Noesis is a production-grade platform for orchestrating specialised AI agents
  with long-term memory, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), tool-calling,
  planning, and self-reflection.  It implements a 12-agent hierarchical
  architecture (Planner, Research, Coding, Memory, RAG, Tool, Reflection,
  Judge, Critic, Executor, Supervisor, Orchestrator) on top of LangGraph,
  with first-class support for 5 LLM providers, multi-tier memory, hybrid
  vector search, and a Hexagonal / Ports-and-Adapters backend suitable for
  enterprise deployment.

